7071C15.3166 16.0976 14.6834 16.0976 14.2929 15.7071L10 11.4142L5.70711 15.7071C5.31658 16.0976 4.68342 16.0976 4.29289 15.7071C3.90237 15.3166 3.90237 14.6834 4.29289 14.2929L8.58579 10L4.29289 5.70711C3.90237 5.31658 3.90237 4.68342 4.29289 4.29289Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></section><a class="affiliate-banner affiliate-banner-custom" href="https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/JywCa" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Affiliate Banner"><img src="https://media.forgecdn.net/banner/console-affiliation-banners/banner_8a9a2ce5-956d-489e-9b46-b41a133d67e5.png" alt="affiliate banner image"/></a><section><div class=" project-description"><p>With this mod as well as the BetterEnd Fabric mod installed, the end cities that generate will be much more intricate in design and will include the wood types and some decorations from the BetterEnd mod.</p>
<p>The end cities will also include more loot as each loot room has more chests.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>This mod is a perfect addition to any modpack that includes BetterEnd Fabric.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>For compatibility with "Lootr", You must download and use this datapack: <a href="/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fdata-pack%252flootr-compatibility-pack-for-betterend-fabric%252f" rel="nofollow">Lootr Compatibility Pack for BetterEnd Fabric Minecraft Data Pack (planetminecraft.com)</a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>An example of the cities can be seen below:</p>
<p><img src="https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/data-pack/2022/896/15572481-betterendcitiesthumbnail_l.webp" alt="Example of BetterEnd Better End Cities" width="800" height="506"></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Also try&nbsp;<a href="https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bigger-better-end-cities" rel="nofollow">Bigger Better End Cities - Mods - Minecraft - CurseForge</a></p>
<p>To have much bigger cities.</p>
<p><br>If a datapack version of this mod is preferable, it can be found here:</p>
<p><a href="https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-end-city-for-better-end" target="_blank" rel="nofollow">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-end-city-for-better-end</a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
